तदहं भक्त्य‍ुपहृतमश्न‍ामि प्रयतात्मन: ॥ २६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2745,\"bb\":2429,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/9/26/b2429/\",\"body_value\":\"patraṁ puṣpaṁ phalaṁ toyaṁ
yo me bhaktyā prayacchati
